      "text": "Combine chicken, potatoes, beef (if using), corn, carrots, green beans, chicken broth, celery, beef broth, tomatoes, onion, bell pepper, cabbage, salt, basil, oregano, celery salt, black pepper, and vegetable base in a large slow cooker. Stir to mix thoroughly and cover.",
